"SUBSTRATE PREPARATION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/sealants-adhesives/sanitary-sealants/sikasil-702.html"}},{"id":"sikasil-702:primer:75343a98","type":"primer","polarity":"yes","conditional":false,"tags":{},"mentions":["sika-primer-3-n"],"text":"Prime surface using Sika® Primer-3 N applied by brush.","heading":"SUBSTRATE PREPARATION","source":{"doc_type":"PDS","url":"https://aus.sika.com/content/dam/dms/au01/f/sikasil-702.pdf","page":3,"page_end":3,"doc_version":"September 2025, Version 01.04","section":"SUBSTRATE PREPARATION","web_url":"https://aus.sika.com/en/construction/sealants-adhesives/sanitary-sealants/sikasil-702.html"}}]}